# rola-bench's graph environment (MODULE.bazel's `environment.python` tag `bench_env`): the fork's stack, on rola's
# torch (the cu13 toolchain's build), which rola-bench's gate, its tests and its local runs import. The packages that
# are not on an index -- the fla fork, the zoology fork, fleet, rola-results -- are pinned by their public commits
# beside the lock (the tag's `packages`), so this lock carries their dependencies. Versions are the ones the hand-made
# venv (rola311-cu13) was proven with. Compiled with `uv pip compile requirements.in --python-version 3.11
# --generate-hashes --extra-index-url https://download.pytorch.org/whl/cu130 --index-strategy unsafe-best-match
# -o requirements.lock`.
